Files used:
  meshes/bases/burger_base.stl
  meshes/wheels/left_tire.stl
  meshes/wheels/right_tire.stl
  meshes/sensors/lds.stl

Modifications for RoboticsSimulator:
  - scaled millimeters to meters
  - converted ROS Z-up chassis/lidar to Chrono Y-up
  - centered each mesh on its AABB
  - uniformly scaled visuals to the existing DiffDrive hulls
    (chassis 0.5 x 0.15 x 0.3, wheel radius 0.1)
Collision / mass / mount frames are unchanged and stay in catalog.json.
